  "ingredients": [
    "3 tablespoons Greek yogurt",
    "2 tablespoons mango chutney (such as Patak's®)",
    "1 tablespoon mayonnaise",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon pepper",
    "0.125 teaspoon curry powder",
    "0.125 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "1 pound pork sausage (such as Jimmy Dean®)",
    "6 eggs, hard-boiled and shelled",
    "0.33333334326744 cup flour",
    "2 eggs, lightly beaten",
    "1 cup panko bread crumbs",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make the dipping sauce: Combine yogurt, chutney, mayonnaise, salt, pepper, curry powder, and cayenne in a small bowl. Refrigerate until ready to use.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the Scotch eggs: Divide pork sausage into 6 even portions. Flatten each portion into a thin patty. Place 1 hard-boiled egg in the middle of each patty and wrap sausage around eggs, sealing all sides. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y4utyI-fWi6g8X6UKRyyKYtWeUk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270943-Air-Fryer-Scotch-Eggs-DDMFS-Step2-2650-4x3-5cf1b06e4db843e6af3a2941f9390191.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270943/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the air fryer to 390 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour in a small bowl, beaten eggs in another small bowl, and panko on a plate. Dip each sausage-wrapped egg into flour, then dip into beaten egg, letting the excess drip off. Roll in panko and place on a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l6ZDC5M-ag_g-TUvVaGJUDr9YEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270943-Air-Fryer-Scotch-Eggs-DDMFS-Step3-2655-4x3-7b1d17f8cb4b41d18ead858fa7878e9f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270943/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray the air fryer basket with cooking spray. Arrange eggs in the basket in a single layer without overcrowding; cook in batches if necessary. Cook in the preheated air fryer for 12 minutes, turning eggs over halfway through. Repeat with remaining eggs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nLA7pFFE2pjbbp_srFgDd5QrYNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270943-Air-Fryer-ScotchEggs-DDMFS-Step4-2656-4x3-533fd0d22cb5422c9dbdc291d1726a3e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270943/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with dipping sauce.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
